==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|vinden|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|findan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*finþaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*pent-||to go, pass; path, bridge}}. Compare Low German {{term|finden|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|vinden|lang=nl}}, English {{term|find|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|finde|lang=da}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈfɪndn̩]|[ˈfɪndən]|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|ɪndn̩|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-finden.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-finden.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=3|findet|fand|gefunden|past subjunctive=fände}}

